\p{
    Most of my formal research work is in [formal specification and verification](dhsorens-000X), especially in [proof assistants](dhsorens-000B) like [Lean](dhsorens-lean), [Rocq](dhsorens-rocq), and the like.

    During my [PhD](dhsorens-phd) and in the years after a lot of time thinking about [smart contract](dhsorens-000Y) design, specification, and verification.
